      "next_step": "Check whether the report export started at 02:12:30 is still running and how many pool connections it (and any parallel export workers) hold, for example with a thread dump or pg_stat_activity filtered on the orders application. If it holds them, stop it or move exports to their own pool or read replica. Also confirm the before/after baseline: the 'before' query returned exactly the same numbers as the 'after' one (ev14 vs ev4), so it may not have been limited to the earlier window.",
